  "details": "I just called this spike connection problem but I'm not quite sure what this is called.\n\nEvery 2-4 minutes, it would make everyone kind of lag and I won't be able to hear anyone then it would return to normal.\n\nI was wondering if anyone's also experiencing this issue.\n\nMy internet speed is stable at 300Mbps upload and download speed.\n\nI'm not sure if this is only on my end or if this is a new issue on vrchat and that only some people experience it because none of my friends experience this.\n\nI've attached a short video demonstrating the issue -- please don't mind the typical conversations in public",
